            "heading": "Will this remove streaks and smudges completely?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes!<strong>Unlike cloths that just push oil around, nook & stitch™ actually lifts dirt, grime, and oil off your lenses.</strong></p>",
