            "heading": "Can it clean the crevices between my lenses and frames?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Absolutely! The <strong>ultrasonic waves reach deep into every tiny crevice </strong>to remove trapped dirt and dust.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
